(7769192, 1289614, 274171, '<td valign="top">
main subject is the smaller flower in center seem to be blur, and the bigger flower seem to be blur too, that make image become seem to be hard to find composition. try to make the center flower less motion blur by adding more exposure time, stronger flash strobe and may be more ND filter if there is smallest aperture. good luck!</td>', 'main subject is the smaller flower in center seem to be blur, and the bigger flower seem to be blur too, that make image become seem to be hard to find composition. try to make the center flower less motion blur by adding more exposure time, stronger flash strobe and may be more ND filter if there is smallest aperture. good luck!', '2024-08-19 04:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
